# The Housefly: Thanksgiving's Bat. It hovers, buzzing its loop, seen mostly
# from above: a striped body lying lengthwise, two big pale eyes at the
# front, pale wings over its back (two voxels thick, so they read from the
# game's camera, which looks down at 32°), and legs dangling.
size 9 6 9
voxel 0.09
colors
  P purple
  d purpleDark
  l purpleLight
  w white
  k ink
# Head, big eyes and their glints.
box 3 2 0 5 4 1 d
box 2 3 0 2 4 1 l
box 6 3 0 6 4 1 l
box 2 4 0 2 4 0 w
box 6 4 0 6 4 0 w
# The middle and the striped body.
box 3 2 2 5 4 3 d
box 3 2 4 5 3 8 P
box 3 3 5 5 3 5 d
box 3 3 7 5 3 7 d
# Wings over the back.
box 0 4 3 3 5 7 l
box 5 4 3 8 5 7 l
# Legs dangling.
box 3 0 3 3 1 3 k
box 5 0 3 5 1 3 k
box 4 0 5 4 1 5 k
